{
  "slug": "qdrant-skills",
  "name": "Qdrant Skills",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Agent skills for Qdrant vector search covering scaling, performance optimization, search quality, monitoring, deployment, model migration, version upgrades, and SDK usage across Python, TypeScript, Rust, Go, .NET, and Java.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **11 skills**.\n\n- **Skills** (11): `qdrant-clients-sdk` (Qdrant provides client SDKs for various programming languages, allowing easy integration with Qdrant deployments), `qdrant-deployment-options` (Guides Qdrant deployment selection), `qdrant-edge` (Guides building on Qdrant Edge, the embedded in-process shard), `qdrant-model-migration` (Guides embedding model migration in Qdrant without downtime), `qdrant-monitoring` (Guides Qdrant monitoring and observability setup), `qdrant-multitenancy` (Guides tenant isolation architecture in Qdrant for multi-tenant or multi-user applications), `qdrant-performance-optimization` (Navigation hub linking sub-skills for proactive Qdrant tuning: search speed, indexing performance, and memory usage optimization), `qdrant-scaling` (Guides Qdrant scaling decisions), and 3 more\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install qdrant-skills@claude-plugins-official` from `qdrant/skills`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "antigravity",
    "codex"
  ],
  "pluginType": "wrapper",
  "wrapper": "skill",
  "sourceType": "community",
